{"id":"en_gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber","title":"Gigolo Mistaken for Plumber","titleEn":"Gigolo Mistaken for Plumber","description":"A simple mix-up over a phone number sets the whole story in motion. Someone asks a friend for a plumber's contact, but the number passed along does not belong to a plumber at all. The husband ends up far from pleased when the truth comes out. The series builds its comedy around this mistaken identity and the awkward consequences that follow from one wrong contact. The details of how the confusion unfolds can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber/en_US/c69ae2d39bc7c269/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d48ae/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d48ae/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d48ae/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d48ae/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7d48ae/?pub=4p6i0m","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_gigolo-mistaken-for-plumber_5","title":"Epis